00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.567
-Now, we do this thing
every week

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:14.868
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:16.901
and we ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:18.567
Thank you all
for playing along.

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:20.300
Spring break is in full swing,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.868
and I sent out a hashtag,
#SpringBreakFail,

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:24.501
and asked you guys to tweet out
your funniest

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:27.334
"spring break gone wrong"
stories.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:30.501
I sent one out,
but this really happened.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:32.934
I went to spring break once,
and we got a cab

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.300
to go back to our hotel,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.634
and the cab pulled over,
and he goes,

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:38.100
"Hey, do one of you guys
want to drive?

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.200
I'm wasted."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.467
It's a true story.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.801
Asked me
if I would drive the cab.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:48.801
Yeah. We waited for another cab,
I think, or we walked.

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:50.300
I think we could see our hotel.
It was crazy.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.000
And it was within minutes,
it was a trending topic

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.868
in the U.S., so thank you
for playing along.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.667
Now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.834
#SpringBreakFail tweets
from you guys.

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:02.400
Here we go. This first one is
